    <DataNode elementId="AT5G58860-MONOMER" textLabel="Cytochrome P450 86A1" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="P48422" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="300" centerY="335" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">CYP86A1 is specifically expressed in roots and is involved in root suberin biosynthesis. Arabidopsis CYP86A1 mutants had a significant reduction of root suberin monomer contents, most notably omega-hydroxyacids of chain length C16 and C18, and alpha,omega-diacids with chain length C16-C20. Among the CYP86 and CYP94 fatty acid omega-hydroxylase subfamilies, CYP86A1 is so far the only one identified to be involved in suberin biosynthesis |CITS: [18544608]|. The catalytic activity of CYP86A1 was demonstrated in microsomes from yeast expressing the Arabidopsis gene |CITS: [9500987]|. CYP86A1 was clearly shown a fatty acid omega-hydroxylase that metabolized saturated and unsaturated mid to long chain fatty acids. The highest catalytic activity was found with palmitate, followed by oleate. Stearate, however, was not metabolized by CYP86A1.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT5G58860-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Araport" value="AT5G58860.1" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Prints" value="PR00385" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pride" value="P48422" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Interpro" value="IPR002401" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pfam" value="PF00067" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Phylomedb" value="P48422" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Prosite" value="PS00086" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Smr" value="P48422" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Uniprot" value="P48422" />
      <Property key="Synonym_1" value="CYPLXXXVI" />
      <Property key="Synonym_2" value="P450-dependent fatty acid omega-hydroxylase" />
      <Property key="Synonym_3" value="HYDROXYLASE OF ROOT SUBERIZED TISSUE" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-33995, RXN-33994, RXN-18717, RXN-12856" />
      <Property key="CatalyzesCount" value="4" />
